# Transactors, Transformers and Beyond. A Multi-Method Development of a Theoretical Typology of Leadership.

**Authors:** Pearce, Craig L., Sims, Henry P., Jr., Cox, Jonathan F., Ball, Gail, Schnell, Eugene, Smith, Ken A., Trevino, Linda

## Abstract
To extend the transactional-transformational model of leadership, four theoretical behavioral types of leadership were developed based on literature review and data from studies of executive behavior (n=253) and subordinate attitudes (n=208). Confirmatory factor analysis of a third data set (n=702) support the existence of four leadership types: directive, transactional, transformational, and empowering. (Contains 95 references.) (Author/JOW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ667378

